### Créer une transaction (remplace l'UUID par celui d'un compte)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountId":"UUID-DU-COMPTE","amount":100,"currency":"EUR","merchantCategory":"FOOD","country":"MA"}

### Plafond dépassé (doit renvoyer 400)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountId":"UUID-DU-COMPTE","amount":1500,"currency":"EUR","merchantCategory":"FOOD","country":"MA"}

### Lister
GET http://localhost:8082/api/transactions